<title>UK: Exide sets 150 mln mark seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>Exide sets 150 mln mark seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-04-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EXIDE HOLDING EUROPE SA</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN DEM   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    15.APR.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    22.APR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  3.0	 REOFFER    **	  SPREAD **+375-400 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	B1	  LISTING    FFT	 PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  B	   DENOMS (K) 1-10-100</p>
<p>SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    N.Y	 HOME CTRY  U.S	 TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p> MGT	  1.2	 UNDERWRIT  1.8	 PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND MARCH 2004 TREUHAND</p>
<p> NOTES	CALLABLE FROM 15.OCT.00</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
